1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:29,150
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:33,210
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:40,080
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:43,390
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:48,190
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:51,860
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:57,910
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:02,710
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,980
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,020
=Episode 8=

12
00:01:20,510 --> 00:01:21,400
Something's wrong.

13
00:01:21,710 --> 00:01:22,430
What is it?

14
00:01:23,870 --> 00:01:24,480
This...

15
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,710
This lamp has no wick?

16
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:28,760
It's a useless lamp.

17
00:01:30,350 --> 00:01:31,760
What's going on?

18
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,289
Is it really the Myriad Souls Lamp?

19
00:01:34,331 --> 00:01:35,480
Could it be a fake?

20
00:01:36,230 --> 00:01:37,120
If it doesn't work,

21
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:38,510
maybe we should just give up.

22
00:01:39,310 --> 00:01:40,120
Give up?

23
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,310
How can we give up?

24
00:01:42,790 --> 00:01:44,070
She'll wake up tomorrow morning.

25
00:01:44,430 --> 00:01:45,480
In just one night,

26
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,560
what could you possibly come up with?

27
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,000
Why not?

28
00:02:02,870 --> 00:02:03,920
Thanks, Shiqi.

29
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:04,840
You can go back.

30
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,870
Chu Li?

31
00:02:11,470 --> 00:02:12,360
Is that you?

32
00:02:13,470 --> 00:02:14,680
Well, you've got good ears.

33
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:15,840
Take it off.

34
00:02:20,710 --> 00:02:22,470
Chu Li, Diviner Song,

35
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:25,080
why did you have me blindfolded?

36
00:02:25,310 --> 00:02:26,360
I was terrified.

37
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:28,289
There's something...

38
00:02:28,331 --> 00:02:30,800
There's something
we'd rather keep quiet.

39
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,280
By the way,

40
00:02:33,590 --> 00:02:34,630
I remember you said

41
00:02:34,910 --> 00:02:36,870
you've studied carving
since you were young.

42
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:37,560
Right?

43
00:02:38,630 --> 00:02:39,680
Yes, I have.

44
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,400
Good.

45
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,910
I need you to make a lamp

46
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,150
identical to this one.

47
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:47,190
If I make it,

48
00:02:47,710 --> 00:02:49,120
will you take me as your apprentice?

49
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:57,870
Make it first.

50
00:02:58,190 --> 00:02:59,120
I'll think about it.

51
00:03:01,630 --> 00:03:02,960
Then give me a few days.

52
00:03:03,150 --> 00:03:04,080
I'll make sure it's done.

53
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:05,960
A few days?

54
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,590
It must be done

55
00:03:09,190 --> 00:03:10,080
before dawn tomorrow.

56
00:03:34,430 --> 00:03:35,190
It's done.

57
00:03:38,590 --> 00:03:39,280
Chu Li,

58
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:41,000
this replica lamp

59
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,680
still needs to be fired.

60
00:03:43,030 --> 00:03:44,910
Then it'll be nearly identical
to the real one.

61
00:03:46,150 --> 00:03:47,840
That's easy. Leave it to me.

62
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,430
Well done.

63
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:51,470
So...

64
00:03:51,910 --> 00:03:52,960
does that mean you agree

65
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,120
to take me as your apprentice?

66
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:00,120
Let me think about it.

67
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:01,520
Rest a while.

68
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,590
We'll talk when I'm back.

69
00:04:06,310 --> 00:04:07,080
Thank you.

70
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,150
Chu Li!

71
00:04:14,420 --> 00:04:16,820
(Grand Shaman's Residence)

72
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,750
Chu Li, what are you up to?

73
00:04:31,950 --> 00:04:33,310
What did I do?

74
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:34,830
But what about you?

75
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,630
Why have you been sleeping on the floor?

76
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,870
Last night you had Diviner Song
lure me away,

77
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:43,480
then stole the Myriad Souls Lamp,

78
00:04:44,070 --> 00:04:45,480
and had that demon bite me.

79
00:04:45,950 --> 00:04:47,720
I won't let you off lightly today.

80
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,240
Yun Hua,

81
00:04:49,630 --> 00:04:51,680
has your cultivation driven you mad?

82
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,680
Can't tell dreams from reality anymore?

83
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:55,000
What nonsense are you spouting?

84
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:55,750
Last night, you clearly...

85
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:56,680
Look, the Myriad Souls Lamp

86
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,040
is right there.

87
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,600
You put it back, didn't you?

88
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:12,000
What did you do
with the Myriad Souls Lamp?

89
00:05:12,750 --> 00:05:14,390
I only got back this morning.

90
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,600
You must be muddled from sleep.

91
00:05:17,430 --> 00:05:18,310
Impossible.

92
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,190
The wound is still here.

93
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,360
Don't try to fool me.

94
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:29,120
Snakes and vermin are common here.

95
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,510
Isn't it normal to get bitten?

96
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,870
You've been sleeping on the floor,

97
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,680
so of course you got bitten.

98
00:05:35,070 --> 00:05:35,750
You...

99
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,430
How dare you still deny it!

100
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,190
Deny what?

101
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:40,870
Do you have proof?

102
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:43,830
So it's true.

103
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:46,390
I never thought you'd be so shameless.

104
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,950
Don't you slander me.

105
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,430
If you dare,

106
00:05:50,750 --> 00:05:52,120
go complain to the Grand Shaman.

107
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:53,720
Oh, right.

108
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:54,600
I forgot.

109
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:56,390
The Grand Shaman is in seclusion.

110
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,800
You can't just go see her.

111
00:05:58,510 --> 00:05:59,800
How unfortunate for you.

112
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,040
You little brat!

113
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:05,630
I will never let you off.

114
00:06:14,310 --> 00:06:15,680
You fooled Yun Hua

115
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:16,830
with such a crude trick?

116
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:19,600
Acting shameless

117
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:20,750
is my specialty.

118
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:23,800
Do you think

119
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,560
this lamp

120
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,270
can still be used?

121
00:06:30,430 --> 00:06:31,270
Maybe

122
00:06:31,830 --> 00:06:32,800
it can't.

123
00:06:33,750 --> 00:06:34,360
No way.

124
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,920
I'll go ask those geezers.

125
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,240
Wait.

126
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:42,430
It's

127
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,160
almost time.

128
00:07:12,220 --> 00:07:15,460
♪Moonlight spills over
gray tiles and walls♪

129
00:07:16,540 --> 00:07:19,070
♪Wind chimes sway, evoking old times♪

130
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:19,750
You...

131
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:21,830
I...

132
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:26,350
♪Twin butterfly shadows in my palm♪

133
00:07:29,190 --> 00:07:30,000
Sorry.

134
00:07:30,390 --> 00:07:31,360
I didn't mean to.

135
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,390
You can't do anything either?

136
00:07:53,750 --> 00:07:54,979
Am I to keep swapping

137
00:07:55,021 --> 00:07:56,360
with Song Ziyuan forever?

138
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,120
If there's no other way,

139
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,190
I'll use Song Ziyuan's identity

140
00:08:05,430 --> 00:08:06,830
to persuade the King
to move the capital.

141
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,680
Or just kill him.

142
00:08:12,630 --> 00:08:13,920
That won't work either.

143
00:08:15,830 --> 00:08:17,510
I can't read a single character.

144
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:19,800
Besides,

145
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:22,000
he doesn't deserve to die.

146
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,750
Diviner Song.

147
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:28,800
You're awake.

148
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,670
Isn't this Chu Li's lamp?

149
00:08:33,790 --> 00:08:34,790
Why do you have it?

150
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,550
I was just looking it over.

151
00:08:44,030 --> 00:08:44,790
Actually,

152
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,720
I understand how you feel.

153
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,320
We're both men, after all.

154
00:08:49,550 --> 00:08:50,270
What?

155
00:08:51,030 --> 00:08:52,030
You like Chu Li,

156
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:52,870
don't you?

157
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:54,750
What are you talking about?

158
00:08:56,270 --> 00:08:58,150
I'm telling you, I could tell ages ago.

159
00:08:58,440 --> 00:09:00,320
Whenever you stand next to Chu Li,

160
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,270
your eyes

161
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,320
never leave her.

162
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:03,790
I... He...

163
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:05,150
Don't play dumb.

164
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:07,440
You were kind enough to take me in.

165
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,550
I'll be sure

166
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:11,080
to put in a good word for you
with Chu Li.

167
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:13,670
What nonsense is that?

168
00:09:17,030 --> 00:09:17,910
What are you laughing at?

169
00:09:19,150 --> 00:09:20,000
I'm laughing

170
00:09:20,270 --> 00:09:22,080
because I'm happy for Chu Li.

171
00:09:22,790 --> 00:09:24,670
With your looks and status,

172
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,200
it's a blessing for her

173
00:09:26,390 --> 00:09:27,870
that you like her.

174
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,270
You like this blessing?

175
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:31,390
Why don't you take it instead?

176
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,790
Diviner Song, what are you saying?

177
00:09:33,870 --> 00:09:34,870
I'm not a woman.

178
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:37,960
I understand.

179
00:09:38,270 --> 00:09:40,150
I won't breathe a word

180
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:41,670
to her.

181
00:09:42,870 --> 00:09:43,630
I get it.

182
00:09:43,750 --> 00:09:45,630
This hazy feeling...

183
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,200
It's rather charming.

184
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:50,480
What the heck?

185
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,030
Do you still want this lamp?

186
00:09:53,790 --> 00:09:54,600
Had enough fun?

187
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,270
I'm returning it to Chu Li.

188
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:57,600
I...

189
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:58,840
You...

190
00:10:02,510 --> 00:10:03,390
What are you laughing at?

191
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,720
Laugh again and I'll cut you down.

192
00:10:20,030 --> 00:10:20,790
Chu Li.

193
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:23,790
Chu Li,

194
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,150
I got the lamp back for you.

195
00:10:27,510 --> 00:10:29,510
Why is the lamp with you?

196
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:32,840
I saw Diviner Song holding it,

197
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,630
so I took it back for you.

198
00:10:43,270 --> 00:10:43,960
Chu Li,

199
00:10:44,550 --> 00:10:45,440
let me tell you something.

200
00:10:46,150 --> 00:10:47,790
Be careful of Diviner Song.

201
00:10:48,510 --> 00:10:49,600
He doesn't seem like a good man.

202
00:10:50,030 --> 00:10:51,200
He always

203
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,750
leers at you.

204
00:10:52,910 --> 00:10:53,840
When did I...

205
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:56,960
No.

206
00:10:58,120 --> 00:11:00,510
When has he ever leered at me?

207
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:02,200
You don't get it.

208
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:04,440
I'm a man. I understand.

209
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,150
What do you understand?

210
00:11:07,870 --> 00:11:08,600
Look,

211
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:09,910
Diviner Song has got

212
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,630
a high position and great power.

213
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:12,910
He must be very calculating.

214
00:11:13,390 --> 00:11:14,910
You're beautiful
and know shamanic arts.

215
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,200
Don't let him deceive you.

216
00:11:20,790 --> 00:11:21,670
But don't worry,

217
00:11:22,030 --> 00:11:22,720
Chu Li.

218
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,360
No matter how others treat you,

219
00:11:24,790 --> 00:11:25,550
I will

220
00:11:25,630 --> 00:11:27,080
stay by your side with all my heart

221
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,360
and never betray you.

222
00:11:32,870 --> 00:11:34,240
Chu Li, he's here.

223
00:11:34,550 --> 00:11:35,390
Be careful.

224
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:38,390
Diviner Song,

225
00:11:39,150 --> 00:11:41,480
I won't interrupt your chat.

226
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:43,480
I'll go catch up on sleep.

227
00:11:51,630 --> 00:11:52,320
Um...

228
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,840
Fusheng didn't know you were me,

229
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,240
so he brought the lamp back to you.

230
00:11:56,750 --> 00:11:57,750
Fusheng?

231
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:00,320
Fusheng? You sound awfully close.

232
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,870
Fusheng's just a young boy.

233
00:12:03,870 --> 00:12:05,120
A bit noisy,

234
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,670
but he's straightforward.

235
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,270
Straightforward?

236
00:12:13,150 --> 00:12:14,270
What did he say to you?

237
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:17,910
Nothing much.

238
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,550
Did he say something to you?

239
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:22,600
Nothing much either.

240
00:12:23,670 --> 00:12:24,390
Fine.

241
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:30,670
Let's study this lamp again.

242
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,360
Answer me this.

243
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:39,390
How did you know beforehand

244
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,390
that my blood

245
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:42,240
could kill those demons?

246
00:12:43,790 --> 00:12:44,390
I...

247
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:46,870
I guessed.

248
00:12:49,670 --> 00:12:50,840
Do you think I'd believe that?

249
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,120
Miss Chu Li,

250
00:12:54,870 --> 00:12:55,670
everyone

251
00:12:56,270 --> 00:12:57,390
needs their secrets.

252
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:01,910
It's a guy thing.

253
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,440
I get it.

254
00:13:10,790 --> 00:13:12,720
I have an idea now.

255
00:13:13,630 --> 00:13:14,480
What idea?

256
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,240
What are you doing?

257
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,240
Bear with it.

258
00:13:33,030 --> 00:13:33,750
Will this

259
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:34,960
work?

260
00:13:35,270 --> 00:13:37,080
Let's try it. Come on, let's try it.

261
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:40,630
Don't waste my blood.

262
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,240
You'll have to

263
00:13:42,750 --> 00:13:44,150
bear this pain for me.

264
00:13:51,150 --> 00:13:51,870
That's about enough.

265
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:53,840
Hurry and wrap it up.

266
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,510
Don't let all my blood drain out.

267
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:19,670
Why isn't it working?

268
00:14:20,550 --> 00:14:22,080
Wasted so much of my blood.

269
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:29,080
Forget it.

270
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:31,750
Chu Li!

271
00:14:41,790 --> 00:14:42,550
It works!

272
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:44,360
It works!

273
00:15:02,390 --> 00:15:03,059
(Why can my blood)

274
00:15:03,101 --> 00:15:04,960
(awaken the wickless Myriad Souls Lamp?)

275
00:15:05,870 --> 00:15:07,299
(How did Song Ziyuan know)

276
00:15:07,341 --> 00:15:08,600
(my blood is different from others'?)

277
00:15:09,630 --> 00:15:10,630
(Who exactly)

278
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,360
(is my mother?)

279
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:21,230
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

280
00:15:22,850 --> 00:15:28,310
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

281
00:15:29,930 --> 00:15:33,160
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

282
00:15:33,330 --> 00:15:36,640
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

283
00:15:36,770 --> 00:15:42,550
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

284
00:15:44,010 --> 00:15:49,230
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

285
00:15:51,090 --> 00:15:57,280
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

286
00:15:57,530 --> 00:16:01,040
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

287
00:16:01,090 --> 00:16:04,379
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

288
00:16:04,421 --> 00:16:11,360
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

289
00:16:11,610 --> 00:16:14,920
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

290
00:16:15,250 --> 00:16:19,160
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

291
00:16:19,210 --> 00:16:25,520
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

292
00:16:54,590 --> 00:17:01,379
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

293
00:17:01,421 --> 00:17:07,600
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
